      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi! Thanks for submitting this CL. I\u0027m a Gitiles user and would very much love dark mode support :)\n\nI\u0027ve tested this CL and wanted to provide you some feedback:\n\n- Several elements in docs (such as [Tables of content](https://gerrit.googlesource.com/gitiles/+/HEAD/Documentation/markdown.md#Table-of-contents) and [notification, aside and promotion blocks](https://gerrit.googlesource.com/gitiles/+/HEAD/Documentation/markdown.md#Notification_aside_promotion-blocks) and the [navigation bar](https://gerrit.googlesource.com/gitiles/+/HEAD/Documentation/markdown.md#navigation-bar), etc.) are still styled in light mode.\n- Links are styled white, and can\u0027t be distinguished from non-links (you only discover they are links when you hover them).\n- The colors for syntax highlighting and diffs haven\u0027t been changed and don\u0027t contrast well with the background.\n\nWhat do you think? If you need any help moving this CL forward, please tell me! I\u0027d love to help.",
      "revId": "0080291364d5ca4600ace9664e5351eefd7bf321",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
